  "content": "<html><head></head><body><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Overclocked_Watches/MP_OverclockedWatches_header.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"549\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">超頻手錶增加了三種新手錶，它們將具有與時間流逝不同的實用功能。現在，玩家可以按自己的意願加速時間，例如，這些手錶可以讓作物更快成長，也可以讓小動物生長，並且可以改變晝夜循環。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>你需要一個伺服器和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Overclocked_Watches/MP_OverclockedWatches_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你正在尋找一個伺服器來和朋友一起玩任何模組或模組包，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong>是你的解決方案！他們有最好的價效比Minecraft伺服器，如果點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">這個連結</a></strong>，你將獲得25%的折扣，代碼為\"Lupin\"</span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Overclocked_Watches/MP_OverclockedWatches_summary.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"140\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">使用三隻新的手錶，放置在Curios API (Forge/NeoForge)或Trinkets (Fabric)的附加插槽中，以下日常任務的時間將會快得多!<br>- 作物生長。<br>- 動物生長。<br>- 按\"&ldquo;O&rdquo;\"鍵更改晝夜循環。<br>新增的三款手錶是金錶、鑽石錶和奈特瑞特表。每隻表都有一定的耐久性，如果使用過度會損壞，且使用晝夜循環時還有一個冷卻時間。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjason13official\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/860325/description_e69745c8-b22d-4d0d-a55e-5c131ae1fe50.webp\" alt=\"Jason13 Ko-Fi\" width=\"286\" height=\"73\"></span></span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Overclocked_Watches/MP_OverclockedWatches_faq.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"140\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>它在服務器上運行嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然! 它可以完美運行! 記住玩Mods和朋友的最好方法是與BisectHosting一起，並通過<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>單擊此鏈接可獲享25%的折扣</strong></a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此模塊能否用於modpack?</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然! 只要它僅在Modrinth或CurseForge上發佈。上傳到任何其他平台都是侵犯我們的權利，完全不被允許。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">然而，如果您考慮將其添加到您的Modrinth或CurseForge模組包中，我們將非常感激。如果您需要任何小更改或有問題，請聯繫我們!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以錄製此mod的視頻並在頻道顯示嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然，你可以在你的頻道播放這個mod或任何我們的modpack並製作視頻，事實上，我們會非常感謝!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Overclocked_Watches/MP_OverclockedWatches_screenshots.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"140\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1048/151/overclocked-watches.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"913\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1048/152/overclocked-watches-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"913\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1048/153/overclocked-watches-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"913\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1048/157/overclocked-watches-6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"913\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1048/158/overclocked-watches-7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"913\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></span></a></span></p></body></html>",
